			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740751701,
					"content": "You carefully inspect the top of the mechanism, but you don't find anything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751702
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740751702,
					"content": "There's nothing here either...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751703,
					"content": "What exactly are we looking for, Caterpillar?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751704,
					"content": "We're looking for the materials necessary to forge the Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751705,
					"content": "The Ordo was able to reproduce the four requisite hypothetical substances here in the material world, based on the esoteric philosophies of the underground kingdom and ancient Fontaine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751706,
					"content": "I do not understand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Seymour"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751707,
					"content": "These enigmatic substances are purely experiential. You could say they are even further beyond ordinary logic than elemental power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751708,
					"content": "I entered all introductory to intermediate level textbooks from the Akademiya's Spantamad into my memory banks decades ago. There is nothing mysterious about elemental power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Seymour"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751709,
					"content": "Is that so? Anyway, to sum up, this is born of the confluence of traditions from Fontaine and technology from the ancient underground kingdom.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751710,
					"content": "And thus, four types of substance came into being: Memory, Wish, Soul, and Persona.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751711,
					"content": "To avoid any possible ambiguity, let's call them the \"Memory\" piece, \"Wish\" piece, \"Soul\" piece, and \"Persona\" piece.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751712,
					"content": "Why are these used to make the Holy Blade?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751713,
					"content": "In the Narzissenkreuz Ordo's brand of mystical philosophy, the temple is a microcosm of the universe, the members are stand-ins for the gods, and the holy oil is tempered willpower.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751714,
					"content": "The Holy Blade, on the other hand, is \"reason,\" that which cuts everything open. It can only be born out of consummate human will.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751715,
					"content": "Quite abstruse.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740751716,
					"content": "That's esotericism for you. You attach yourself to anything that looks similar enough, and when this sort of thing becomes magic, fiction becomes reality.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740751717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				},
				{
					"id": 740751717,
					"content": "Anyway, we should make our way to the next area now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Caterpillar"
				}
			]
		},
